  unitName: Holy Flame Vargas
  unitId: 10015
  unitNumber: 338
  description: A swordsman from the ruined Agni Empire and one of the Six Heroes
    feared by even the gods. Even Vargas couldn't escape unscathed when faced with
    the impregnable forces of the gods. As he faded away, he heard Lava's distant
    voice, "Take my wings. I don't need them anymore." When he came to, he found
    blazing wings on his back, but Lava was nowhere in sight.
  summonDesc: You've summoned me in this form.<br>You seem to know about me. <br>Let
    me show you what I've got!
  fusionDesc: Holy flames, lift my wings!<br>I'll rule the fire that'll scorch the
    <br>gods to ashes, just watch!
  evoDesc: You can see my wings?<br>As long as I have these wings, <br>I shall not
    be defeated!
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
